      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51a4eb64763395a5faea8c7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "竟然会提不起力气……\r\n看来是自我管理没做好……",
      "source_fingerprint": "13a04dcda72515506e28789c800b4e2f93c07cfa628597677e6b8d7938079e46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c2bbc48d60d57962e8bf689",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊，我的深层腹肌开始躁动了……\r\n一直站在这里实在太浪费时间了，\r\n我们赶快开始吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d0fc4f7ffdb0996cbb9113584e8a8b95d89536e237aa9f48a0c2f2f70d7cd1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:138377b617aa89445c388a3f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已等不及要活动我的肌肉了……！\r\n请务必让我做严苛的训练！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "24413f7c7d5862afcfd254b8598cf06a563e2b5fc146ec200015c60d64b91130",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31d7b1cfc1de2f5b4aece2bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉力量源源不绝！\r\n尽情地锻炼来挥洒汗水吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5318a29cabaed257a3b668923d55d629edcfb09e9bfca2030b6b32ebc84f462",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5dd13a48596faf3c70f4e888",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Let's muscle！\r\n嗯，感觉今天有从丹田发声，\r\n很不错哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d9599f9cab8b62bebb99f6802bd6cf095bf46693baa1388d1651529b96a91d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2d0ec271ea1a09e3fe747fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的训练排程\r\n该不会是要做重训吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ed40baa6274a963cf523515810ade07fb0abb74236abe9bc6352488f6cf72b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2def643b6abeb012cf20b6d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的肌肉都已经准备好了。\r\n请下达指示吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "39975cac29c98425c4c225b72726f9753071151f1df2704b786056bdd1bfca5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55aa8554af2b96f89eafe5b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奇怪，今天的肌肉感觉\r\n没有平常紧实……\r\n是我想太多了吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf77b8feb95f39a55cd127529077e04e379933e003eabbc873f91f6ba07daea3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
